# Internal abilities moving wizard bonus feat slots to the Method lists
# Source: The (mostly) Complete Dragon Magazine Compendium - Feats, Flaws & Styles (compendium pp. 1058-1176).
# DESC ends with the original Dragon Magazine issue and article. SOURCEPAGE = compendium PDF page.
# Prerequisites that could not be expressed as PCGen PRE tags are listed in PRETEXT.

Greyhawk Method Wizard Feats	KEY:DMC ~ Greyhawk Method Wizard Feats	CATEGORY:Internal	DEFINE:Pool_GreyhawkWizardFeat|0	BONUS:VAR|Pool_GreyhawkWizardFeat|min((WizardLVL/5),4)	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|-min((WizardLVL/5),4)	DESC:Wizard bonus feats may be chosen from the Greyhawk Method list (the normal list plus Combat Casting, Greater Spell Focus, Greater Spell Penetration, Magical Aptitude, Spell Focus, Spell Penetration).
Nexus Method Wizard Feats	KEY:DMC ~ Nexus Method Wizard Feats	CATEGORY:Internal	DEFINE:Pool_NexusWizardFeat|0	BONUS:VAR|Pool_NexusWizardFeat|min((WizardLVL/5),4)	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|-min((WizardLVL/5),4)	DESC:Wizard bonus feats may be chosen from the Nexus Method list (the normal list plus Augment Summoning, Fiendsign, Greater Spell Focus, Greater Spell Penetration, Spell Focus, Spell Penetration).
Silent Method Wizard Feats	KEY:DMC ~ Silent Method Wizard Feats	CATEGORY:Internal	DEFINE:Pool_SilentWizardFeat|0	BONUS:VAR|Pool_SilentWizardFeat|min((WizardLVL/5),4)	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|-min((WizardLVL/5),4)	DESC:Wizard bonus feats may be chosen from the Silent Method list (the normal list plus Combat Casting, Greater Spell Focus, Greater Spell Penetration, Magical Aptitude, Spell Focus, Spell Penetration).
Sagacious Method Wizard Feats	KEY:DMC ~ Sagacious Method Wizard Feats	CATEGORY:Internal	DEFINE:Pool_SagaciousWizardFeat|0	BONUS:VAR|Pool_SagaciousWizardFeat|min((WizardLVL/5),4)	BONUS:VAR|Pool_WizardFeat|-min((WizardLVL/5),4)	DESC:Wizard bonus feats may be chosen from the Sagacious Method list (the normal list plus Eschew Materials, Greater Spell Focus, Greater Spell Penetration, Magical Aptitude, Spell Focus, Spell Penetration).
